Chapter: J1939EncodeTest

  cites Encode chapter J1939

Section: Helpers

  flag : Boolean -> Integer
  flag (b) = if b then 1 else 0

Section: Checks

 Engine Hours (PGN 0xFEE5, PDU2), priority 6, source 0: identifier
 0x18FEE500.

  check-can-id : Integer
  check-can-id =
   flag (j1939-can-id 6 254 229 0 == #18FEE500)

  check-pgn-pdu2 : Integer
  check-pgn-pdu2 =
   flag (j1939-pgn (j1939-can-id 6 254 229 0) == #FEE5)

  check-priority : Integer
  check-priority =
   flag (j1939-priority #18FEE500 == 6)

  check-source-addr : Integer
  check-source-addr =
   flag (j1939-source-addr #18FEE501 == 1)

 PDU1: PGN 0xEA00 (request, PDU format 234), destination 0x21 in the
 PDU-specific field. The PGN recovers to 0xEA00 (destination excluded).

  check-pgn-pdu1 : Integer
  check-pgn-pdu1 =
   flag (if j1939-pgn (j1939-can-id 6 234 33 0) == #EA00 then j1939-ps (j1939-can-id 6 234 33 0) == 33 else False)

  opening : Integer =
   let a = check-can-id
   in let b = check-pgn-pdu2
   in let c = check-priority
   in let d = check-source-addr
   in let e = check-pgn-pdu1
   in a + b + c + d + e
